iz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWEIfz9LktODTjvxCAWiblVRv9AGD0Lzf0tMF0wicGjsunwUgVCXGOXvOt7b8DAJRnvfE6DRFr7k0GYia0lX4E7xaic3qKB36RxJ7D0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"],"video":"","videos":[]},"full":true,"addedAt":"2026-10-13T11:25:04.063Z","content":[{"t":"text","v":"阿维塔06的造型设计极具辨识度，整体呈现出科技与运动融合的风格，前脸采用了家族式的“猎豹凝势”美学理念，营造出犀利且富有科技感的视觉效果。前机盖线条自然衔接L型日间行车灯，增强了前脸的立体感。这种低趴的设计让整车看起来特别有战斗气息，摆脱了“大众脸”的困境，原创猎装美学每一处设计都兼顾视觉个性与实用价值。说实话，阿维塔确实在小编的审美点上。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWGzSXDvtAaic5ZecKSFd3wLmyguo2RrEGWlWXxktc7AoIHFGU8Xk7g6ibblfiaTevXvyiaZZADpsH94gZfy9gh0kqysNHPbG3fe5OI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"但造型不是车辆销量的唯一因素，自打25年04月上市以来，销量未见明显亮点，但， QQQ这不是我们今天关注的重点，我们来看看灯。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KTj61r3bYWGsqdpkfxmcEWqxpXau4GEygUQcojdXK0WJAGoKibECZwuj3cNGh2jt6YuboVvEemQiapTZ7oXSaWaEUoqe3TPyOiaIxxkuSS7pBg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"一体式大灯，夸大的F的形日行灯给人印象深刻，而弱化的主光源放置下面低调不张扬；"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWE43vtQGjdviaoqSxjGKDJjZ5n7ibdnSTsJ5XibcWkMOj74sgxp9MR6NzpsYOjDNib9SMRV0Z0rCvLNHZevEm4IFLI5ltvF4nRy92o/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"灯壳上的信息，有需求的同学请自取。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWEGJZehiaicFKGPOx8kNorB7I2ngfIPibZ4WZxn73sfjLNoBVNuUTn6TfhbfhroVmIWy8tMOSc1RK0rUIycJkpEkBnJe5XEoLne9A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWHMdnd3icMzu1CfpyePcSmFP4g4jgu6vSribzlePA2GfEhQH1hREVicibwoxrSbyrRdyCNStG5nkFRrJ34r6gx9sDqhfsKUErydtOM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"打开面罩，远近光椭球及日行灯凸显，精致感满满，"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWGUfpiaLgWmabfwIpdZHO1g5VxEdqsTvx4K7hjNUnmcuWnib6AJDiaSSvfu59icFhEn9ibNBlqKThEWD8281s1JEIm5HTAH88lE1xbk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"取下主饰圈，日行厚壁及光源板肉眼可见，主流发光方式，"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWF9uVCnSic0jZKa